s-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;$9,935,100&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 339.95pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 11.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 5.85pt;text-align: justify;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;letter-spacing: -0.05pt;;display:inline;"&gt;Transportation services provided to Omega Pipeline LLC&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 99pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 11.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 5.85pt;text-align: right;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;641,300&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 339.95pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 11.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 5.85pt;text-align: justify;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;letter-spacing: -0.05pt;;display:inline;"&gt;Transportation services provided to Spire Marketing, Inc.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 99pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 11.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 5.85pt;text-align: right;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;29,000&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 339.95pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 11.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 5.85pt;text-align: justify;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;letter-spacing: -0.05pt;;display:inline;"&gt;Rent payments to Spire Properties Wentzville LLC&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 99pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 11.4pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 5.85pt;text-align: right;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;61,600&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 115.0%;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 115.0%;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Environmental Matters&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 115.0%;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The Company is subject to federal, state and local laws and regulations governing environmental quality and pollution control. These laws and regulations require the Company to remove and remedy the effect of the disposal or release of specified substances at current and former operating sites.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Liabilities for environmental costs are recorded when it is probable that obligations have been incurred and the amounts can be reasonably estimated. The Company is not aware of any material environmental liabilities that should be recorded with respect to compliance with applicable laws and regulations. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 115.0%;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Subsequent Events&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 115.0%;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Management evaluates subsequent events through the date financial statements are available for issue, which is the date of the Independent Auditors&amp;#8217; Report, and has determined that there are no subsequent events requiring disclosure as of that date.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
